OL,3,GNEWSAMinister found guilty of 11 sexual
OL,4,Aassault charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA religious minister who was a senior
OL,7,Fmember of the Methodist Church in
OL,8,FCornwall has been found guilty of 11
OL,9,Fsex charges.
OL,11,FAt Truro Crown Court, Steven Wild, 72,
OL,12,Fof St Ives, had denied 10 charges of
OL,13,Fsexual assault and one of indecent
OL,14,Fassault between 2004 and 2015.
OL,16,FProsecutors said Wild sexually
OL,17,Fassaulted five women who came into
OL,18,Fcontact with him because of their
OL,19,Finvolvement with the church. Wild said
OL,20,Fhe hugged and pecked men and women on
OL,21,Fthe cheek and was tactile, but denied
OL,22,Fsexual assaulting any of the women.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
