OL,3,GNEWSAMinister found guilty of 11 sexual
OL,4,Aassault charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury rejected his account, finding
OL,7,Fhim guilty. He was released on bail and
OL,8,Fis due to be sentenced in December,
OL,9,Fwith the judge saying all sentencing
OL,10,Foptions would be open.
